Homepage: https://github.com/herumi/msoffice
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: msoffice-crypt
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Encrypt and decrypt OOXML Microsoft Office documents
 msoffice-crypt encrypts and decrypts Office Open XML documents (docx, xlsx,
 pptx) with a password. This package builds it from upstream source (commit
 b5fed29), replacing the earlier package that shipped a prebuilt x86-64 binary.
